# Default-deny: ship only what the runtime needs (requirements.txt + src/).
# Anything not explicitly re-included here stays out of the build context.

**

!requirements.txt
!src
!src/**

# Persona avatar images (served at /avatars/<slug>). Scoped to this one subdir
# so the rest of images/ (docs/marketing assets) stays out of the runtime image.
!images
!images/AgentChat-Avatars
!images/AgentChat-Avatars/**
